 "title": "The tangent to x = 2t + 1, y = t² − 3t at t = 2",
 "caption": "Eliminating t gives y = (x − 1)²/4 − 3(x − 1)/2, a parabola. At t = 2 the point is (5, −2) and dy/dx = (dy/dt)/(dx/dt) = 1/2, so the tangent is y = ½x − 9/2.",
 "alt": "A parabola opening upwards with its minimum near x = 4 and the tangent of gradient ½ touching it at (5, −2).",
 "description": [
  "At t = 2: x = 2(2) + 1 = 5 and y = 4 − 6 = −2.",
  "dx/dt = 2 and dy/dt = 2t − 3 = 1.",
  "dy/dx = (dy/dt)/(dx/dt) = ½.",
  "Tangent: y + 2 = ½(x − 5), that is y = ½x − 9/2."
